00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:15.400
Oh.

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.900
I think she's a woman who can do anything!

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:21.030
She feels like a woman who can do anything.

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:25.990
Most of them said you're the type of woman who'd do anyone!

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:28.660
Present that one detail more accurately.

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:32.790
Dried Squid and Takatoshi, Max Power!

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:34.750
The Resolution!

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:38.250
I'm sorry for bothering you...!

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:38.670
Please wait!
I'm sorry for bothering you...!

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:39.750
Please wait!

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:41.880
Tralala~

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:49.430
Cr**mpie Attack!

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:53.060
The End!

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:58.310
Something's on the floor.

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:01.190
Hey, Tsuda!

00:18:01.190 --> 00:18:02.320
I'm sorry!

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:04.240
You can't skullf*ck people!

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:06.700
As if I would be the type to do that.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:15.710
Taka-kun!

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:26.380
Can I go to your house next time?

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:33.220
Calling me that in front of people is a little...

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:34.470
Oh, my bad.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.810
Shall I only call you by your pet name in a private setting?

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:41.110
You're making it worse!

00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:45.030
So, to sum it up, his parents are going on a trip,

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:47.900
and in that time,
you wanna stop over at Tsuda's house

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:49.820
since you're worried about him being alone.

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:50.870
Yes.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:55.200
Um... You don't really need to.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.580
Besides, I have Kotomi with me.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:00.250
Oh.

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:04.500
I'm gonna stay at Tokki's place, so I won't be there.

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:05.760
Huh?

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:20.190
Taka-kun, it's morning now.

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:25.650
I see.

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:28.610
My parents and Kotomi aren't here,

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:31.530
so Uomi nee-san came to stay for the night.

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:34.950
There's a person to make me breakfast when I wake up.

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.120
I'm pretty grateful.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:38.960
Morning!

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:42.670
There's a crowd of people
making me breakfast when I wake up.

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:43.880
I should be careful.

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:47.260
So, what's up with you guys?

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:49.340
You're here so early in the morning.

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:51.300
Well, you see...

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:56.470
Everyone was worried about
how you spent the night, Taka-kun.

00:19:56.470 --> 00:19:57.310
Huh?!

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:59.640
Don't get any ideas!

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:01.140
We weren't worried at all!

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.560
That's right!

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:05.690
Huh? Was it because of me?

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:07.860
I will just accept your feelings.

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:10.450
Don't accept them! Set them aside!

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.200
Taka-kun!

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:23.210
Wha... N-Nee-san...

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:29.880
Which is what happened.

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:31.340
That was close.

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:37.100
Um... I called you last night around 7,
but nobody answered.

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.350
What were you doing?

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:41.980
Oh, at that time...

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:42.020
Wanna have a milk bath?

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:43.480
Last night
Wanna have a milk bath?

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:44.440
Wanna have a milk bath?

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:46.360
Your skin will be silky smooth

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:47.480
Oh...

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:49.980
We got in the bath together.

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:52.990
It's sorta true, and yet it's not.

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:57.410
Come on, baby.

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:58.870
Wow...

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:01.250
That's all there was to it.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:03.750
The milk bath felt great.

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:07.080
If you just look at the picture,
it looks more like a **men bath.

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:08.210
No it doesn't.

00:21:11.090 --> 00:21:13.590
Feel free to use this room.

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:14.630
Thanks.

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:18.600
Taka-kun, I have a favor to ask...

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:22.060
Please don't look at me when I'm sleeping, okay?

00:21:22.060 --> 00:21:24.520
Huh? Well, I won't peek though....

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:26.650
It's embarrassing,

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:28.360
but my sleeping posture is bad.

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:30.780
Like kicking the futon around?

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:34.320
To prevent that, I use tools to restrain myself.

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:36.360
It'll be embarrassing if I'm seen like that!

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:37.910
And you can sleep after that?

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:42.370
And so we had a very sound night.

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:43.790
Was it really?

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:47.330
Looks like you've stopped frowning.

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:49.840
You seem to be satisfied, right?

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:50.550
Oh...

00:21:50.550 --> 00:21:51.670
Have we?

00:21:51.670 --> 00:21:55.470
By the way, the clock's arms are also frowning.

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:57.800
Crap! Crap! Crap! Crap!

00:21:57.800 --> 00:21:59.300
That's all there is.

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:38.030
I wrote this down as the Student Council President.

00:24:44.970 --> 00:24:50.270
Okay, you laughed! You lose, President.
I'll take my meal now.

00:24:50.270 --> 00:24:52.440
You're so unfair, Kotomi!

00:24:54.190 --> 00:24:55.520
That again?

00:24:55.520 --> 00:24:56.480
Oh my.

00:24:56.480 --> 00:24:57.230
Kotomi!

00:24:57.230 --> 00:24:58.570
Oh, about...

00:24:58.570 --> 00:24:59.860
What a terrible trick.
